    "sentence_translations": [
      "Guess what this is?",
      "",
      "One day, teacher said:",
      "“A big red hat sits on its head, and the body wears multicolored clothes.”",
      "“In the morning it sings, calling people to get up early. Students, can you guess what this is?”",
      "",
      "A lot of students answered: “It’s a rooster!”",
      "Only Little Ming after he thought for a moment, said in a loud voice: “It’s mom!”",
      "",
      "Teacher asked: “Why?”",
      "",
      "Little Ming answered: “What you said is exactly like my mom.”",
      "“My mom likes to put on a red hat, her clothes have many different kinds of colors, which are multicolored.”",
      "“But also what’s most important,” ..",
      ".. “early in the morning, her favorite thing to do is to sing while she calls to me to get out of bed.”"
    ]
